# Normalize to LF in the repository and in every working tree, regardless of platform.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true produces CRLF files that fail
# `npm run format:check` on a clean clone, while Linux CI passes. It also matters for correctness:
# the shell scripts and Dockerfile in this repository are executed inside Linux containers, where
# CRLF line endings break interpreters.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly binary so they are never line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
